<BaseLayout
  title="POC Tech Team — Peptides of China"
  description="The POC Tech Team is the editorial and technical team behind Peptides of China: sourcing, batch documentation, COA review and research-use content."
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> › Author</p>
    <h1>POC Tech Team</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      POC Tech Team is the editorial and technical team behind Peptides of China. The team writes and
      reviews the sourcing, quality, handling and catalogue content on this site.
    </p>

    <h2>What the team covers</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Supplier and factory verification questions</li>
      <li>Batch documentation, COA fields and analytical methods</li>
      <li>Research-use handling, storage and reconstitution boundaries</li>
      <li>China export and destination-market documentation context</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Editorial boundary</h2>
    <p>
      POC Tech Team writes for research procurement, not medical use. The content does not provide
      human dosing, injection, treatment or cure advice. Product pages describe research materials;
      they are not medical claims.
    </p>

    <h2>Corrections and contact</h2>
    <p>
      For a factual correction or document question, use the
      <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>. Include the page URL, the exact sentence and the source
      that should be checked. Do not send confidential formulas or personal medical information.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
